<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 2.0 bln Skr in five-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 2.0 bln Skr in five-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of five-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1130 GMT on February 12.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1039</p>
<p> Auction date			    Feb 12, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date			   April 12, 2002</p>
<p> Coupon  (pct)			   5.50 pct</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)   2.0 bln Skr</p>
<p> Settlement date			 Feb 17</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
